# Built lwk_wasm bindings (produced from SWK's lwk_wasm: wasm-pack build --target web --release).
# Symlinked/copied in at deploy; not tracked.
pkg
pkg/
# EXCEPTION: the vendored SeqLN Tier-2 device-signer wasm (the Lightning module's
# on-device signer) IS tracked. It is a different artifact from the lwk_wasm pkg
# and ships with the wallet so the "Instant (Lightning)" route works.
!lightning/pkg/
!lightning/pkg/**

# Agent worktrees and local agent state (never belongs in the repo).
.claude/
